name drac
category Package
revision 15878
shortdesc Declare active character substitution, robustly
relocated 1
longdesc The package provides macros \DeclareRobustActChar and
longdesc \ReDeclareRobActChar. One uses \DeclareRobustActChar in the
longdesc same way one would use \DeclareRobustCommand; the macro
longdesc \protects the active character when it appears in a moving
longdesc argument. \ReDeclareRobActChar redefines an active character
longdesc previously defined with \DeclareRobustActChar, in the same way
longdesc that \renewcommand works for ordinary commands.
runfiles size=1
 RELOC/tex/latex/drac/drac.sty
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/drac
